      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1350442300,
      "text": "Englerophytum magalismontanum, commonly known as stamvrug, is an evergreen tree that mostly grows in rocky places. It has an extensive range, from northern KwaZulu-Natal northwards along the east coast and into the southern African interior, and northwards into tropical Africa."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Englerophytum magalismontanum",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Englerophytum_magalismontanum",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 159992269,
      "text": "Englerophytum magalismontanum (Sond.) T.D.Penn., es un árbol siempreverde que usualmente crece en lugares rocosos, con una amplia distribución desde el norte de KwaZulu-Natal a lo largo de la costa este y hacia el interior, hacia al norte hasta África tropical."
    }
